Package: com.cooperwang.iosminer
Name: iOSMiner
Version: 1.3.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Bitcoin SHA-256d miner for iOS. Connects to Stratum v1 mining pools and performs proof-of-work on device CPU.
